          "id": 43,
          "start": 127.13,
          "end": 128.003,
          "en": "if we want to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 130.11,
          "end": 132.93,
          "en": "And in here, we can now add what we learned about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132.93,
          "end": 137.93,
          "en": "We can add data, we can add methods, we can add computed.",
